@prefix CHEBI: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_> .
@prefix EDAM: <http://edamontology.org/> .
@prefix EFO: <http://www.ebi.ac.uk/efo/EFO_> .
@prefix GIVReST: <https://doi.org/10.14573/altex.2501011#> .
@prefix ISO10991: <https://www.iso.org/standard/82146.html#> .
@prefix ISO22916: <https://www.iso.org/standard/74157.html#> .
@prefix MAMO: <http://identifiers.org/mamo/MAMO_> .
@prefix MESH: <http://id.nlm.nih.gov/mesh/> .
@prefix MIACA: <https://doi.org/10.5966/sctm.2015-0393#> .
@prefix MISpheroID: <https://doi.org/10.3390/jdb10010007#> .
@prefix NCIT: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_> .
@prefix OBI: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OBI_> .
@prefix OECD: <https://www.oecd.org/chemicalsafety/testing/> .
